@startuml
!include ../../../_common/style.puml

title Consume L2 - ConsumeDecision Provider Ack Mapping

box "Core Consume" #FFF3E0
participant MessageConsumerAdapter
end box
box "Provider" #FFEBEE
participant KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper
participant PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper
participant RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper
end box

MessageConsumerAdapter -> KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper: map(ACK)
KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumerAdapter: commit offset + 1
MessageConsumerAdapter -> KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper: map(RETRY)
KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumerAdapter: no commit / seek current
MessageConsumerAdapter -> KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper: map(DISCARD)
KafkaConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumerAdapter: commit offset + 1

MessageConsumerAdapter -> PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper: map(ACK / DISCARD)
PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumerAdapter: acknowledge
MessageConsumerAdapter -> PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper: map(RETRY)
PulsarConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumerAdapter: negativeAcknowledge

MessageConsumerAdapter -> RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper: map(ACK / DISCARD)
RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumerAdapter: CONSUME_SUCCESS
MessageConsumerAdapter -> RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper: map(RETRY)
RocketMqConsumeDecisionMapper --> MessageConsumerAdapter: RECONSUME_LATER
@enduml
